Package: 1bit-ryzenadj
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: 1bit <packages@1bit.gg>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libpci3, libudev1, zlib1g
Description: SMU power limits for this board (RyzenAdj v0.19.0)
 The tool 1bit-board writes the power profile with: sustained, slow
 and fast PPT limits and the die temperature limit through the SMU.
 The EC power mode on its own gives the firmware's profile; the 90 W
 sustained cap this appliance ships needs these limits written.
 Built from the pinned source shipped in /usr/share/doc/1bit-ryzenadj
 (v0.19.0, LGPL-3.0, Copyright Jiaxun Yang and the RyzenAdj
 contributors), which is what LGPL-3.0 asks a binary to travel with.
